  message: "Folds in WI-jalal (owner-approved 2026-11-01, root-cause sweep 2026-11-01 (dev b27eb0e0d0; lab ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/tracker_hygiene_sweep_2026-11-01T223538Z/); WI-jalal closed wont_do with duplicate_of here). WI-jalal's own 11-01 review: 43 of its 78 field-target edges are correct calls through function-typed fields; the defective rest are this item's hint-less short-name lookup binding a non-function. A kind/call-shape filter here removes WI-jalal's bad binds. Read WI-jalal's thread for its repro and evidence."  # 4eba
